## BOTTOM TABS (LOCKED)

- App has EXACTLY three tabs:
  - Home
  - Shop
  - Profile
- Tabs are top-level destinations, NOT flows
- Tabs must NEVER be conditionally hidden
- Tabs must NEVER contain onboarding or creation screens
- Tabs must NEVER be renamed, reordered, added, or removed

---

## GLOBAL NAVIGATION HIERARCHY (IMMUTABLE)

NavigationContainer
└── RootStack
├── OnboardingStack
└── AppStack
├── BottomTabs
│ ├── HomeStack
│ ├── ShopStack
│ └── ProfileStack
└── ActionFlows

- This hierarchy must remain intact
- Stacks must NOT be merged or flattened
- ActionFlows must NEVER live under BottomTabs

---

## ROOT STACK RULES

- Entry decision only (onboarding vs app)
- No feature screens allowed
- No business logic allowed
- No conditional rendering beyond routing decision

---

## ONBOARDING STACK RULES (STRICT)

- No bottom tabs
- Linear, gated flow
- One-time only
- Controlled back navigation

### Mandatory Screen Order

Splash  
→ IntroCarousel  
→ GetStarted  
→ OTPVerification  
→ Your Details  
→ ConnectHealth
→ PlanPreview  
→ BottomTabs (via AppStack)

Allowed screens ONLY:

- Splash
  → IntroCarousel  
  → GetStarted  
  → OTPVerification  
  → Your Details  
  → ConnectHealth
  → PlanPreview  
  → BottomTabs (via AppStack)

Exit rule:

- After `OnboardingSuccess`, navigation state MUST reset into AppStack
- User enters BottomTabs
- Back navigation to onboarding is forbidden

---

## APP STACK RULES

Structure:

- AppStack
  - BottomTabs
  - ActionFlows

Rules:

- Tabs ALWAYS visible inside BottomTabs
- Tabs ALWAYS hidden inside ActionFlows
- Tab visibility must NEVER be controlled via state

---

